  "sourceTitle": "[AINews] Quasi-Riemann-Hypothesis: OpenAI publishes 722 math papers solving 90 of the top 500 open math problems; “the most significant moment” in >100 years of mathematics",
  "sourceBodyHash": "32f279486dce690e3092ac866d50d911d38b1e4b04eef34b888366f0bca6cbe5",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-07T06:49:40.307667Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-07T06:52:48.760836Z",
  "totalBlocks": 98,
  "translatedBlocks": 48,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a26737aec160a2d",
      "translationZh": "AIE NYC 的门票即将售罄！下周见！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaa4f58e499e702f",
      "translationZh": "查看过去的 AINews 期刊以获取订阅者折扣。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d705816e47a822be",
      "translationZh": "为 Mistral 倒一杯，他们在最近的 Series D 融资资助的全新 3800 GB300 集群上发布了一个体面的 Large 4 “Le Chonk” 模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f54a66b50a1fbe2b",
      "translationZh": "但他们被 OpenAI 内部 Navier-Stokes 数学模型的更多数学结果所掩盖——该模型以博客文章、代码库和推文的形式发布。最高的赞美来自他们的 Navier-Stokes 竞争者 Anthropic，尽管他与 Anthropic 有个人分歧，但他不吝啬言辞：“这显然是数学史上最重要的时刻。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5106271bb6c8bf62",
      "translationZh": "这有一定的限制，但大多数专家似乎同意它解决了许多数学前 500 大未解问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e6766b2ef1d2b78",
      "translationZh": "特别是，结果 003，即准黎曼假设，介于菲尔兹奖级成果与“过去 200 年数论领域最大的成果”之间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c56f1b6039e441d9",
      "translationZh": "最令人惊讶的是——虽然 Navier-Stokes 用了 88 小时和 10,000 个代理，但这些解决方案平均仅需 3 小时的 ChatGPT Pro。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "696d6c0098fa59c5",
      "translationZh": "AI News 2026/10/05-2026/10/06。我们检查了 12 个 subreddit，544 条 Twitter，没有进一步的 Discord。AINews 的网站让你搜索所有过去的期刊。提醒一下，AINews 现在是 Latent Space 的一个栏目。您可以选择订阅或退订邮件频率！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df78d900f5dd8e9c",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 发布了来自未发布内部模型的 722 份数学手稿",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e315966ad289a48f",
      "translationZh": "该发布：OpenAI 在公开的 GitHub 仓库中发布了一套来自内部前沿模型的广泛数学成果。它表示已咨询了高等研究院独立的数学与人工智能咨询小组，以决定如何发布这些成果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dd1e311a245738b",
      "translationZh": "规模与计算：据称该收藏包含 722 份手稿，分为 372 个相关结果家族。这些手稿源于对约 4,000 个研究问题的评估，并且每个结果平均使用了大约三小时的 ChatGPT Pro 思考算力（摘要、Rundown）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "066fb01fae780c03",
      "translationZh": "制品：此次发布包括论文、证明制品以及选定的推理摘要。该模型本身仍未发布。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3860444611843b63",
      "translationZh": "框架：萨姆·阿尔特曼称其为“发现的新时代”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1f6f746996b7070",
      "translationZh": "值得注意的声称结果：这些结果由个别评论员报道，尚未经过独立验证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2a42c71374beb8c",
      "translationZh": "整数乘法：一位贡献者强调了一个整数乘法结果，其速度快于 n log n。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5778e56716307735",
      "translationZh": "弹性逆问题：另一位贡献者指出了弹性逆问题的唯一性结果，该论文称该问题自 1994 年以来在三维空间中一直未解。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "979bf6b8effc8e45",
      "translationZh": "千禧年相关工作：评论者指出在黎曼、霍德和BSD方面取得了部分进展。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6cbe20e1edb03fb",
      "translationZh": "数学家反应：Levent Alpöge 赞赏了准黎曼和无西格尔零点的结果，并称其为“数学史上最重要的时刻”。他还指出其他实验室用户报告的抄袭和利益冲突问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dff69a87f7a18306",
      "translationZh": "结果构成：一项分析估计约20%的结果是反驳或反例。它认为这削弱了AI数学胜利主要依赖暴力搜索的说法。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "657ebc4097539ca4",
      "translationZh": "怀疑与未解问题：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "720b0d5d561ce702",
      "translationZh": "预期错误：Will Depue 预计有些结果经不起审查。他建立了 citedbyagi.com 以追踪该发布引用了哪些人类论文。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "534791305f0a2488",
      "translationZh": "计算框架：Teortaxes 指出三小时的计算“不算多”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2124517c583c7a1",
      "translationZh": "泛化：François Chollet 询问在RLVR友好的数学和代码中的进步是否能够泛化，或者不可验证的领域是否仍然受限于人类数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2603c5bbff0b3132",
      "translationZh": "Mistral Large 4（“Le Chonk”）：发布、定价和有争议的评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5dbbf822c26757c",
      "translationZh": "Mistral Large 4 预览版：该模型总参数为 1T，活跃参数为 49B，原生多模态，现已通过 API 提供（公告）。开放权重将在十月底前承诺提供。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e12fbc0e5a5d22cf",
      "translationZh": "训练状态：RL 运行“仍在进行中，且未见饱和迹象”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50fc85d68a835d02",
      "translationZh": "计算：该模型在欧洲约~3,800 块 Grace Blackwell 上进行了预训练和后训练。目前正在训练一个更大的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b53d339e733a6805",
      "translationZh": "定价：每百万输入/输出 token 为 1.36/4.18，缓存输入费用为 0.14，前两周享受 5 折（人工分析）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f7188144eb8f8ea",
      "translationZh": "上下文：Vals 和 Artificial Analysis 列出 512K 上下文窗口。OpenRouter 列出 1M 上下文，最高可达 256K 输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5facbcc8f9e9b20",
      "translationZh": "人工评估：Mistral 表示在人工评估中，其在 STEM、CAD 和 金融方面胜过 GLM 5.3，在智能体编码方面持平。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59001d429e3afd72",
      "translationZh": "编码基准：它报告在 DeepSWE 上超越 GLM 5.3，在 Terminal-Bench 4 上超越 Kimi K3（Rozière）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf7d6d9e212e67b8",
      "translationZh": "盲测评审：在一次盲测 Surge 编码评审中，它排名第二，仅次于 Opus 5。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0735fd5ef8668eb7",
      "translationZh": "独立测量：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aef522deb429e48b",
      "translationZh": "人工分析：它在智能指数上得分为38，与GPT-6 Luna（最高）持平，也是美国和中国以外的最高得分。它在网络指数上得分为50，在CyberGym-E2E-AA上得分为82%。每项任务成本为1.13，是同等智能开放模型的4倍以上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e56017592ca75de7",
      "translationZh": "Vals：它在HLAB上的开放权重排名第一，在开放模型的Vals指数上排名第九。大量使用上下文将其每测试成本推高至13.78。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c611ce2229a307d8",
      "translationZh": "临床分诊：一位评估者报告在669项临床决策中并列第一，且没有严重失误。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d30363393363259c",
      "translationZh": "注意事项和分歧：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84f3dc11a5d0876a",
      "translationZh": "拒绝效应：Cline 将网络领先主要归因于更少的拒绝，称 Opus 5.5 和 Astra 有约 40% 的任务被其自身安全过滤器阻止。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc76fc860eb50ad9",
      "translationZh": "指数差距：批评者指出，它在AA的指数上落后于GLM-5.3甚至GLM-5.3-Flash。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a36f908d029bdae",
      "translationZh": "开放权重声明：Hugging Face 的 CEO 指出，直到权重发布之前它并不是开放权重。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "080f17ddb721df15",
      "translationZh": "配置：Mistral 警告称，许多报告的失败源于未将 reasoning_effort 设置为 \"high\" 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cca447e8e197099",
      "translationZh": "蒸馏假设：Yuchen Jin 推测，作为未经证实的观点，认为西方-中国开放模型差距反映了中国实验室提炼 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 模型的能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7515ce7251b557b",
      "translationZh": "开放权重和 API 模型发布：嵌入、图像、决策模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "121cd81ddab578ce",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2：Google 首个原生多模态开放嵌入模型，覆盖文本、代码、图像、视频和音频，统一在一个空间。它基于 Gemma 4 构建，并在 Apache 2.0 许可下发布（DeepMind）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd5fcbadc5fd66aa",
      "translationZh": "规格：它是模块化的，包含 740M 全能、440M 文本+视觉、570M 文本+音频和 270M 纯文本变体。它具有从 768 降到 128 的 Matryoshka 维度，8,192 上下文长度，以及在 MTEB Code 上报告的 +14% 提升（Phil Schmid）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b5aa89fa86ca443",
      "translationZh": "占用空间：它大约使用 191–567MB 活动内存，并可处理最多 5.5 分钟的音频或每次通过 58 视频帧（Google）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9484f605ba5a7c14",
      "translationZh": "生态系统：Day-0 支持涵盖 llama.cpp、vLLM、Ollama 和 Unsloth。它还可在浏览器上通过 WebGPU 运行，每次查询约 20–70毫秒。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fd8d6568a89430a",
      "translationZh": "Nano Banana 2.1：Google 更新的图像模型正在 Gemini 应用、AI Studio、搜索和广告中推出（Google）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
